From: Vylen Linux Team <wonkru-dev@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:17:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix string ABI version comparison in sipbuild

sipbuild may receive abi_version components as strings. Comparing the
major component with integer 14 then raises TypeError and aborts the
PyQt6 build. Convert the major component to int before the comparison.

--- a/sipbuild/project.py
+++ b/sipbuild/project.py
@@ -1007,3 +1007,11 @@
-        # ABI v14 requires Python v3.15 as a minimum.
-        if self.abi_version[0] >= 14 and version < (3, 15, 0):
+        # ABI v14 requires Python v3.15 as a minimum.  Some configurations
+        # leave the ABI version components as strings, so normalise the major
+        # version before comparing it with an integer.
+        abi_version = self.abi_version
+        if isinstance(abi_version, str):
+            abi_major = int(abi_version.split('.', 1)[0])
+        else:
+            abi_major = int(abi_version[0])
+
+        if abi_major >= 14 and version < (3, 15, 0):
             version = (3, 15, 0)
